# The DolphinDB Software Evaluation License Agreement, which the download
# requires you to accept (README.txt: "Before you install and use DolphinDB,
# you must read and agree to the included license agreements"), grants use
# "internally within Your facilities solely for the purpose of evaluation"
# (§3), and §6 CONFIDENTIALITY then adds: "You may not use the Evaluation
# Software or any information relating to the Evaluation Software except for
# the purposes stated in Section 3 above."
#
# No clause names benchmarks, but publishing measurements is not internal
# evaluation. So treat the numbers the way ClickBench treats a DeWitt clause
# (top-level README, "If The Results Cannot Be Published"): keep the
# reproduction scripts, keep the results out of the repository.
results/
